{"id":"da6c8cddfa68d44a","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-topo8-upper-semicontinuous-map.md","title":"ZFC Topo8 Upper Semicontinuous Map","display":"df-zfc-topo8-upper-semicontinuous-map — ZFC Topo8 Upper Semicontinuous Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo8-upper-semicontinuous-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo8-upper-semicontinuous-map"],"display":"df-zfc-topo8-upper-semicontinuous-map — ZFC Topo8 Upper Semicontinuous Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo8-upper-semicontinuous-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo8-upper-semicontinuous-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo8-upper-semicontinuous-map — ZFC Topo8 Upper Semicontinuous Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(f,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8UpperSemicontinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8UpperSemicontinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}upper\\text{-}semicontinuous\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8UpperSemicontinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(\\{x\\in X:f(x)&lt;r\\}\\in\\tau\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}upper\\text{-}semicontinuous\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8UpperSemicontinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(\\{x\\in X:f(x)&lt;r\\}\\in\\tau\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Upper semicontinuity is expressed by open strict sublevel sets in the\ndeclared domain topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8UpperSemicontinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}upper\\text{-}semicontinuous\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8UpperSemicontinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(\\{x\\in X:f(x)<r\\}\\in\\tau\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1098,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3717","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-topo8-upper-semicontinuous-map.md|58-df-zfc-topo8-upper-semicontinuous-map]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e7514bc4cefba4f2","36d7463d215be751"]}